    "name": "📌 Moonshot AI API (Kimi)",
    "description": "### About Moonshot AI\n\n\"Welcome to Moonshot AI. Our mission is to seek the optimal conversion from energy to intelligence.\"\n\nMoonshot AI builds the Kimi models and serves them through OpenAI-compatible Chat and Responses APIs. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Model makers**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Moonshot AI Account: [https://platform.kimi.ai/](https://platform.kimi.ai/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `moonshot_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:moonshot_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://platform.kimi.ai/docs/api/overview](https://platform.kimi.ai/docs/api/overview)\n    \n- Models: [https://platform.kimi.ai/docs/models](https://platform.kimi.ai/docs/models)",
